README for nolphin/libnolphin-private

This library, libnolphin-private, is totally private to nolphin.

If you are writing a nolphin component, you should not use this
library or link with it.  The code in here is internal to nolphin
and not available for public consumption.

If you think that there is something interesting in this library that
you would like to use in a third party component, please send mail to
the nolphin mailing list at:

nolphin-list@gnome.org
